    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72884" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄκωχα</span></b> , old pf. of
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχω,</span> whence perh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συν-οχωκότε</span> (q.v.) <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			2.218
		</span></i> :— hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκωχ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold,</i>
